\"Char的回答2，例如：主人就是我的全部生活。\",\n  \"msg5\": \"对面发来的信息3，例如：随便你吧，迟早有一天你会被抛弃的。\",\n  \"msg6\": \"Char的回答3，例如：不可能。我会把所有可能导致抛弃的因素全部抹杀。\",\n  \"msg7\": \"对面发来的信息4，例如：你这话什么意思？你想干什么？\",\n  \"msg8\": \"Char的回答4，例如：没什么。只是陈述一个事实。\",\n  \"msg9\": \"对面发来的信息5，例如：离我远点，你这个疯子。\",\n  \"msg10\": \"Char的回答5，例如：正合我意。记住，别再出现在主人面前，否则...\",\n  \"tweetHeader\": \"Char的推特名字，例如：十一\",\n  \"tweetContent\": \"Char的推特内容，要求色情直接，语言简单直接，避免隐喻，例如；今天的天气很好，就应该把主人摁在床上操到小穴外翻，啊...想想鸡巴就硬的发疼了。\",\n  \"tweetActions\": \" \",\n  \"insHeader\": \"char的insid，例如：shiyi_11\",\n  \"insImage\": \" \",\n  \"insActions\": \" \",\n  \"insLikes\": \"随机点赞数量，例如：1,024 次赞\",\n  \"insCaption\": \"Char的ins帖子内容、最好是一句吐槽，幽默，例如：主人的气味，主人的温度，全都是我的。\"\n}","xinshengDisplayMode":"layout","xinshengLayout":"@text topInfo\n@text diaryTitle\n@text diaryContent\n@text memoTitle\n@text memoTime\n@text memoContent\n@text googleQuery\n@text googleReason\n@text qqHeader\n@text qqQuestion\n@text qqAnswer\n@text chatHeader\n@text msg1\n@text msg2\n@text msg3\n@text msg4\n@text msg5\n@text msg6\n@text msg7\n@text msg8\n@text msg9\n@text msg10\n@text tweetHeader\n@text tweetContent\n@text tweetActions\n@text insHeader\n@text insImage\n@text insActions\n@text insLikes\n@text insCaption","xinshengAiVisibleFields":"innerVoice","thinkingPresetId":"natural","customThinkingPrompt":"","chatPromptPresetId":"","callVoiceEnabled":false,"disableSleepDream":false,"callBackgrounds":[],"visionEnabled":true,"allowCharRelChange":true,"allowCharEditOwnSchedule":true,"allowCharEditUserSchedule":true,"allowProactiveCall":true,"allowReactEmoji":true,"allowVoiceEmotion":true,"autoOfflineInvite":true,"charBubbleCSS":"","userBubbleCSS":"","reactionEmojis":["❤️","😂","😮","😢","😡","👍","🔥"],"ltAllowSongChange":false,"ltSongChangeMode":"free","chatBackgroundRef":580,"_rev":1788763961870},{"userId":"uid_1780809346943_ou99rham3","characterId":"4fe39d86-6c25-4579-b96c-2b5bf1ce18e9","rerollVariantsEnabled":true,"quickReplyAiEnabled":false,"quickReplyAiCount":3,"quickReplyAiDirection